# Backend-only configuration.
#
# The canonical template is ../.env.example. Copy it into this directory:
#
#   cp ../.env.example .env
#
# The VITE_* keys are ignored by the API. For a backend-only run, set
# DATABASE_URL and CORS_ORIGINS as needed, and set BASE_URL plus
# AUTH_GOOGLE_ID/AUTH_GOOGLE_SECRET when enabling Google OAuth.
#
# See ../backend/README.md for the backend-only setup and ../README.md for the
# normal combined ./dev workflow.
